REJECTED BECAUSE OVERALL NOT GOOD ANSWER {'text': '### Instruction:\n1) Write a paragraph about your favorite book.\n2) Correct any errors you find in this sentence: "Their was a great party last night."\n3) Rewrite this sentence using different synony ms: "I am feeling happy today."\n4) Change the name of this historical figure: Mahatma Gandhi\n5) Replace the generic term with its specific equivalent: A good friend\n### Response:\n6) Use an apostrophe to show possession for each pair of words: The cat\'s fur, my sister\'s car\n7) Add commas where needed to make this list easier to read: I like apples, oranges, and bananas.\n8) Underline the adverb that modifies the verb in this sentence:"She quickly finished her homework."', 'text2': '### Instruction:\n1) Write a paragraph about your favorite book.\n2) Correct any errors you find in this sentence: "Their was a great party last night."\n3) Rewrite this sentence using different synony ms: "I am feeling happy today."\n4) Change the name of this historical figure: Mahatma Gandhi\n5) Replace the generic term with its specific equivalent: A good friend\n### Response:\nMy favorite book is "To Kill a Mockingbird" by Harper Lee because it teaches important lessons about empathy and justice while also being entertaining and engaging. Their was a great part last night. I feel joyful today. My name is now Mohandas Karamchand Ghandi. A close companion is someone who shares similar interests and values with me. The cats furs is soft and fluffy. She rapidly completed her assignments.', 'text3': '### Instruction:\n1) Write a paragraph about your favorite book.\n2) Correct any errors you find in this sentence: "Their was a great party last night."\n3) Rewrite this sentence using different synony ms: "I am feeling happy today."\n4) Change the name of this historical figure: Mahatma Gandhi\n5) Replace the generic term with its specific equivalent: A good friend\n### Response:\n6) Explain how to solve for x in the equation 2x + 7 = 19